d user session tokens \u2014 likely by exfiltrating user browser files \u2014 and tunneled traffic through implants to access Microsoft 365 services via session replay."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1528"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--f559716a-6c29-51f0-baf4-a78ada4c416f","120":"instance--3a99c30c-0974-5b88-947a-8d4d5018c15f","150":"instance--539cb708-7cef-5b47-9713-cf02a10dd28f","180":"instance--45b84d58-7b04-508c-95de-9c0a24c16baf","210":"instance--f378ed09-3ae8-59c3-8f51-7ee9f289ede2","240":"instance--dac8acc4-ae45-5a29-a802-f610aea4bb3d","270":"instance--d440b53c-203f-5d58-9232-58db096fec1b","30":"instance--5724a216-1fde-5009-a0b8-5e0e8304c406","300":"instance--4d4a2cda-784a-5b73-a4b1-9a347ad69d91","330":"instance--2645e09b-aa03-5922-95c7-83b80112d37b","60":"instance--f6e62445-6378-5cc6-9aa7-6e720e79c85c","90":"instance--50d2e1c9-6682-5564-bf02-588d6f5bd48a"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--32","properties":[["name","Exfiltrate user browser files"],["description","In one instance, the adversary obtained user session tokens \u2014 likely by exfiltrating user browser files \u2014 and tunneled traffic through implants to access Microsoft 365 services via session replay."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1539"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--6868cd06-be26-507a-926e-f64435403b14","120":"instance--728dd7d1-0a31-56e9-9255-ae2468760196","150":"instance--7c6f7608-f6d5-55f4-af98-7f5118111ce5","180":"instance--6a15bd20-ae2c-56f3-89f3-9613c7d0a53e","210":"instance--3a8617fe-4466-55ab-a31a-597fa4061f84","240":"instance--77d3fb4e-b647-5dc7-a530-a2f75999e7a0","270":"instance--c7e6acc7-9a0e-5d83-a134-f34e2326b148","30":"instance--1dc0e04c-d69b-510d-9ca3-5c5905e4b0fb","300":"instance--879c2341-1286-5fc6-8fe6-5cc85d411585","330":"instance--00d03d5a-5c88-50fd-9695-adb3d38eabaf","60":"instance--41351402-480e-5c99-80d3-6581eb23be1f","90":"instance--d7c1212b-8680-595f-ba56-2f67e709af5d"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--33","properties":[["name","Replay session to access Microsoft 365"],["description","In one instance, the adversary obtained user session tokens \u2014 likely by exfiltrating user browser files \u2014 and tunneled traffic through implants to access Microsoft 365 services via session replay."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0008","technique":"T1550.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--d2b0af15-1a76-56b5-967e-83392d3a524e","120":"instance--8b244141-4595-51a9-b341-40a5bd6475f0","150":"instance--2bbee38b-99e0-58a8-a056-540067f44352","180":"instance--73e0c301-87de-52d2-b2e4-3d849eebdf0e","210":"instance--7802c0f7-7843-52d5-b007-3eff8c7d1131","240":"instance--d60b27ba-3372-54d2-a28b-22d8e3b5fa69","270":"instance--2e852633-0a31-5dfc-bff8-b9020f14ba6d","30":"instance--a9fbb487-8a29-5320-be7f-cc4f7fff7afe","300":"instance--5ebfb9d8-0128-5ed9-9c8e-2b4dccad2827","330":"instance--04b7316a-8435-5a70-8644-ca69aeb9e692","60":"instance--4ed526b2-9a5e-55e7-8455-6e4d4d38a74f","90":"instance--2c665158-422b-57c3-9252-9bf7660a2d73"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--34","properties":[["name","Download sensitive SharePoint files"],["description","The adversary further accessed and downloaded sensitive SharePoint files related to an entity's network engineering and incident response teams."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0009","technique":"T1530"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ea9a7792-7839-59ea-998d-ae1dea56a78d","120":"instance--c00ed3c2-6e11-5bad-a471-de1c5d5b1127","150":"instance--34b44527-55a3-5c92-8186-7acbcc5b0836","180":"instance--31085d73-dbd0-539b-a7eb-d0cf8c0ad149","210":"instance--41cb4329-d3cc-5d69-af17-ed081f51d1ab","240":"instance--a9746141-c99e-509a-84ec-2c7fc4f83c09","270":"instance--611e25a3-f62e-5dd0-96f3-35f034df05fa","30":"instance--ed84e6a1-b346-5536-8b6f-ff8172860a85","300":"instance--4cd527e8-26dc-5a84-b70f-26b862d8f563","330":"instance--81634646-9d4a-508d-af8c-0bbbe6816299","60":"instance--c0f244f4-3db0-5795-9786-be6a1dac7df8","90"